{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. You help him to find the Mystery Circus and discover the secrets fields of Fantastic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush through the Space before the Time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Klown.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a modern Maze Runner Adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown before your Time runs out?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2239190?t=1755102604","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239190/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755102604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755102604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755102604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. You help him to find the Mystery Circus and discover the secrets fields of Fantastic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush through the Space before the Time runs out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Klown.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzle Exploration focused. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragr